    "name": "Moo Moo Move",
    "steam_appid": 987880,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/987880/extras/610c82aa9ded120c884964de7dfb6c6d.poster.avif?t=1666349350\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/987880/extras/610c82aa9ded120c884964de7dfb6c6d.webm?t=1666349350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/987880/extras/610c82aa9ded120c884964de7dfb6c6d.mp4?t=1666349350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><u><strong>DESCRIPTION</strong></u><br>MOO MOO MOVE is a casual arcade game about guiding chubby cows to safety. Players drive the herd through a host of cute floating islands built with a country feel. UFOs, poachers, ice and more stand between the cows and their next meal - it's down to the player to get them there!<br><br><u><strong>HISTORY</strong></u><br>MOO MOO MOVE began as a Tranzfuser project in 2017, where it was awarded funding for its continued development. It is the first game to be released by graduate team MOCHI MODE.<br><br><u><strong>FEATURES</strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique hand-painted island levels.<br></li><li>A host of hazards to tackle.<br></li><li>Cute visuals that make you feel relaxed.<br></li><li>8 round cows just looking for a snack!</li></ul><br>Now in Welsh, Swedish, Norwegian and Chinese (Simplified)",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/987880/extras/610c82aa9ded120c884964de7dfb6c6d.poster.avif?t=1666349350\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/987880/extras/610c82aa9ded120c884964de7dfb6c6d.webm?t=1666349350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/987880/extras/610c82aa9ded120c884964de7dfb6c6d.mp4?t=1666349350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><u><strong>DESCRIPTION</strong></u><br>MOO MOO MOVE is a casual arcade game about guiding chubby cows to safety. Players drive the herd through a host of cute floating islands built with a country feel. UFOs, poachers, ice and more stand between the cows and their next meal - it's down to the player to get them there!<br><br><u><strong>HISTORY</strong></u><br>MOO MOO MOVE began as a Tranzfuser project in 2017, where it was awarded funding for its continued development. It is the first game to be released by graduate team MOCHI MODE.<br><br><u><strong>FEATURES</strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique hand-painted island levels.<br></li><li>A host of hazards to tackle.<br></li><li>Cute visuals that make you feel relaxed.<br></li><li>8 round cows just looking for a snack!</li></ul><br>Now in Welsh, Swedish, Norwegian and Chinese (Simplified)",
    "short_description": "Enter an adorable world where you and your chubby steed are tasked with herding cows to safety. Gallop through beautifully hand crafted environments and a host of hazards in this relaxing casual arcade game!",
